{"product_id":"lucy-locket-online-disaster","title":"Girls can VLOG: Lucy Locket, online disaster","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNEWSFLASH . . . VLOGGING IS GO!It's bad enough having to move house, school and country all at the same time, without making a fool of yourself on the first day of term. But that's just what Lucy's done - and one of her classmates has videoed the whole thing and put it online!Lucy's so stressed, her stammer's become worse than ever. So when a friend encourages her to create her own videos, she thinks it's a terrible idea - surely she's embarrassed herself enough for one lifetime! But when Lucy finally gives vlogging a try, she's amazed to find that people actually want to watch . . .Includes tips for making your own vlogs!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions:18 x 200 \u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Emma Moss \u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9781509814916 \u003cbr\u003eFormat: paperback \u003cbr\u003ePages 272\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43403647942809,"sku":"9RB9781509814916","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/lucy-locket-online-disaster-573202.jpg?v=1752150880","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/lucy-locket-online-disaster","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}